    "updated_at": "2020-09-03T17:13:58Z",
    "body": "Thanks for weighing in, @rakina! That pushes me toward that design, then. In that case, this spec PR is good. It might be worth trying to point out the causal relationship, e.g. adding a sentence after the \"Navigate to...\" one, but I'm not sure exactly how to phrase it.\r\n\r\n@johnivdel, will it be OK to update Chromium to fire beforeunload (with no prompting)?",
